gin="00:20.867" end="00:21.259">much </span><span begin="00:21.259" end="00:21.668">time </span><span begin="00:21.668" end="00:21.987">on </span><span begin="00:21.987" end="00:22.643">people </span><span begin="00:22.643" end="00:22.900">that </span><span begin="00:22.900" end="00:24.051">reminded </span><span begin="00:24.051" end="00:24.347">me </span><span begin="00:24.347" end="00:24.691">of </span><span begin="00:24.691" end="00:25.053">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:25.595" end="00:30.929"><span begin="00:25.595" end="00:25.780">Gave </span><span begin="00:25.780" end="00:25.939">you </span><span begin="00:25.939" end="00:26.123">a </span><span begin="00:26.123" end="00:26.780">million </span><span begin="00:26.780" end="00:27.460">reasons </span><span begin="00:27.460" end="00:27.660">to </span><span begin="00:27.660" end="00:27.972">walk </span><span begin="00:27.972" end="00:28.411">away</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.929" end="00:35.773"><span begin="00:30.929" end="00:31.128">But </span><span begin="00:31.128" end="00:31.321">I'll </span><span begin="00:31.321" end="00:31.586">build </span><span begin="00:31.586" end="00:31.763">a </span><span begin="00:31.763" end="00:32.193">house </span><span begin="00:32.641" end="00:32.785">out </span><span begin="00:32.785" end="00:32.945">of </span><span begin="00:32.945" end="00:33.104">the </span><span begin="00:33.104" end="00:33.266">mess </span><span begin="00:33.625" end="00:33.833">and </span><span begin="00:33.833" end="00:34.162">all </span><span begin="00:34.162" end="00:34.361">the </span><span begin="00:34.361" end="00:35.105">broken </span><span begin="00:35.105" end="00:35.773">pieces</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.773" end="00:40.731"><span begin="00:35.773" end="00:35.972">I'll </span><span begin="00:35.972" end="00:36.468">make </span><span begin="00:36.468" end="00:36.843">up </span><span begin="00:37.028" end="00:37.268">for </span><span begin="00:37.268" end="00:37.819">all </span><span begin="00:37.819" end="00:38.324">of </span><span begin="00:38.324" end="00:38.726">your </span><span begin="00:38.726" end="00:39.979">tears</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:40.731" end="00:46.076"><span begin="00:40.731" end="00:40.892">I'll </span><span begin="00:40.892" end="00:41.060">give </span><span begin="00:41.060" end="00:41.212">you </span><span begin="00:41.212" end="00:41.388">the </span><span begin="00:41.388" end="00:41.855">best </span><span begin="00:41.855" end="00:44.500">years</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.076" end="00:52.172"><span begin="00:46.076" end="00:46.259">I'll </span><span begin="00:46.259" end="00:46.429">give </span><span begin="00:46.429" end="00:46.603">you </span><span begin="00:46.603" end="00:46.836">the </span><span begin="00:46.836" end="00:47.412">best </span><span begin="00:47.412" end="00:50.054">years</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.172" end="00:54.883"><span begin="00:52.172" end="00:52.387">Fast </span><span begin="00:52.387" end="00:52.835">love </span><span begin="00:52.835" end="00:53.084">burned </span><span begin="00:53.084" end="00:53.372">out </span><span begin="00:53.372" end="00:53.692">like </span><span begin="00:53.692" end="00:53.924">a </span><span begin="00:53.924" end="00:54.532">cigarette</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:54.883" end="00:57.620"><span begin="00:54.883" end="00:55.108">I </span><span begin="00:55.108" end="00:55.764">promise </span><span begin="00:55.764" end="00:56.428">darling </span><span begin="00:56.428" end="00:56.637">you </span><span begin="00:56.637" end="00:56.828">won't </span><span begin="00:56.828" end="00:57.367">regret</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.620" end="01:04.150"><span begin="00:57.620" end="00:57.877">The </span><span begin="00:57.877" end="00:58.365">best </span><span begin="00:58.365" end="01:01.076">years</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:04.150" end="01:09.616"><span begin="01:04.150" end="01:04